    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu kwimanīīcha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose yūmuna ū Yosefu, ūlemeelwa ū kwiyūmīlīja ū kū būtongi wa batūmami bakwe abo baalīho; ūūtandūka kūlīla alīhaya, “Bapeejagi pye abo balī ng'wenūmu, bīnge ū kū būtongi wane.” Hūna ū Yosefu wimanīīcha ū kū baana ba ng'wawe, a bangī pye batīho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlīla no n'ilaka lya higūlya kūshisha a Bamisili bigwa, nū kwikūlū lya ng'wa Falao gūshika ko ū mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūbawīla, “Ū nene nalī Yosefu! Ū baba ataalī alīho mpanga?” A baana ba ng'wawe būjinjimala bagayiagwa ū gwa kūshosha, bakūdetemaga dūhū ū kū būtongi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūbawīla a baana ba ng'wawe gīkī, “Bing'we egeelagi aha!” Aho bīīta gīko ūbawīla, “Ū nene hū nalī nzuna wing'we, ū Yosefu, ūyo mukanjinja Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo lekagi gete ū kūpīnīhahala, nūūlū kwisaayīla bing'we benekīlī angū īkī mukanijinja kūūnū; nguno ū nene wanitūma Mulungu natonge ū kūūnū, kūlwa kūpīja būpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha yashikaga myaka ībīlī īlīho nzala ū musī; ū kū būtongi yasaagaga ko yīngī ītanò, īyo ītī ya kūlīma nūūlū kūgesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mulungu akanitonja kūūnū ū nene kūlwa kūshilang'hana ī shibyalīlwe shing'we ū mu sī, na kūbūpīja ū būpanga wing'we mu kapīlīle kataale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya ītī bing'we abo mukanenha ū kūūnū, walī Mulungu ūyo ī haha wanīīta kūbiza ise wa ng'wa Falao, na ntaale wa kaya yakwe yose; na nsugi ū mu sī ya Misili ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ī haha jagi wangū ū kūlī baba mukang'wīle, ‘Ū ng'witūnja wako ū Yosefu alīhaya gīkī, Ū Mulungu wanīīta kūbiza ntaale wayo pyī ī sī ya Misili; nzūgū wangū ū kūūnū nalī, ūtizūdīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkwikala mu sī ya Gosheni, bbihī nū kūko nalī ū nene ūkwikala kwenūko ū bebe ng'wenekīlī, na a baana bako, na a bizūkūlū bako, na a madaale gako ga ng'holo na a ga ng'ombe; nī shose īsho ūlī nasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūkūlang'hana ko ū kwenūko; nguno ītaalī īliza ko myaka ītanò ya nzala. Ūlū ītī chene, ū beebe na a bose abo ūlī nabo mukūkoya no.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we benekīlī mulībona na miso ging'we, pye nū nzuna wane ū Benjamini alībona, gīkī hū nene nalīmuwīla ī yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'winhagi ū baba ī mhola j'ikūjo īlo nīīlūkīlwa ū kūūnū Misili, nī yīngī pyī īyo mulīyībona; nīyo ū baba mung'wenhe kūūnū wangū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wiponya a halī nzunaaye ū Benjamini, ūnkumbatīla wandya kūlīla, kūnū nū Benajamini nang'hwe akūlīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye na a bakūlūye ūbabbipa kūnū akūbalīlīīlaga; hanuma ya henaho a baana ba ng'wawe būhooya nang'hwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isilaeli asaamīle Misili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mhola aho jashika ū kwikūlū lya ng'wa Falao, gīkī bizaga baana ba ng'wawe na Yosefu, ū Falao na a bana ng'oma bakwe bakayega no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao ūng'wīla ū Yosefu gīkī, “Bawīlage a baana ba ng'wing'we; ‘Ītagi gīkī, jibbakīlījagi ī nzobe jing'we ī miligo, mushoke ū kū sī ya Kanaani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukang'wenhe ū sīng'we, nī kaya jing'we kūūnū nalī. Nakūng'winha ī shawiza īsho shilīmo ū mu sī ya Misili; mukūshilūmba ī shizeeze sha sī īyī.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ūlīkomelejiwa kūbawīla gīkī, ‘Solagi magogoteeni kūfuma kūūnū Misili, mukababūūche a baana bing'we na a bake bing'we; mumūche nū sīng'we mung'wenhe kūūnū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutizikala mulīkoya koyela shikolo shing'we, nguno pyī ī shawiza sha mu Misili shikūbiza shing'we.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Isilaeli bīīta chene ng'hana; ū Yosefu ūbinha magogoteeni, gīt'umo akalagīīlīla ū Falao. Ūbinha na shiigunaanīlo sha mu nzīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bose ūbinha būlī ng'wene shizwalo sha kwaalūla; alīyo ū Benjamini ūng'winha shekeeli magana adatū ja feza, na shizwalo shitanò sha kwaalūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūlī ise ūtwala shikolo īshi, Nzobe ikūmi jibūūkije shikolo shawiza kūfuma mu sī ya Misili, na nzobe ng'hīma ikūmi jibūūkije būsīga na migatī kūlwa ng'wa ise kūtūmamīla mu nzīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbalaga a baana ba ng'wawe būja; aho alīlekana nabo ūbawīla, “Lang'hanagi mutiziduumīla mu nzīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīnga ī Misili, būlinha kūja Kanaani, būūkashika ū kūlī saabo ū Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla, “Baba ū Yosefu ataalī alīho mpanga! Nīyo hū ntaale wa sī yose ī ya Misili.” Ū Yakobo ūūkaba! Nīyo atabazunīlīgije, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūshisha būnsomboolela pyī ī mihayo īyo akabawīla ū Yosefu, ūgabona na a magogoteeni ayo walī wagatūma ū Yosefu kwiza kūmūcha. A henaho lūūlū ū moyo gwakwe hū gūshoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isilaeli ūhaya, “Naazunya lūūlū ī haha, ū ng'witūja wane ū Yosefu ataalī mpanga ng'hana. Nakūja nakamone aho nataalī kūcha!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
